{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-binghatti-haven","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"binghatti-haven-dubai-sports-city","about":"Binghatti Haven at Dubai Sports City is an exquisite residential development by Binghatti Developers, offering 501 studios, 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments. Each residence is thoughtfully designed, blending luxury with functionality, perfect for both families and professionals. The project, featuring 26 residential floors, is strategically located near Motor City, Dubai Hills, and City Centre Meaisem, ensuring easy access to key destinations.Haven by Binghatti boasts a striking architectural design with sleek lines and modern interiors. Residents enjoy premium amenities such as basketball courts, a green maze, kids' aqua pool, and a smart home system. The development features spacious living areas with expansive windows, offering stunning views of Dubai Sports City.Binghatti Haven’s prime location provides direct access to major road networks and public transport, making it a highly desirable place to live. Investing in Binghatti Haven offers both comfort and luxury, with a promise of strong long-term value. With its superior design and strategic position, Haven is a true symbol of modern living in Dubai.","price":750000,"title":"Binghatti Haven","bitrix":{"id":1078,"pf_id":"are.2.14541","source":null,"project_id":"Binghatti Haven","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Binghatti Haven","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Binghatti","project_location":"Dubai Sports City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Binghatti_Haven_by_Dubai_Sports_City_8ea8f8a050.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Binghatti_Haven_by_Dubai_Sports_City_8ea8f8a050.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0438088,"lng":55.2185702},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront